      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "- The Exteranal LB could come from :\n    \n    ° the Cloud Provider\n    \n    ° could be a hardware based Load Balancer\n\n    ° could be a software based Load Balancer\n         - e.g. : haproxy running on a separate \n                  virtual machine",
